ered),
      # EYES-ART (eyestruct raster-gates the horcrux stones + favicon),
      # TEXT-REF (poststruct's eyes-reference pack: og:image must be REAL
      # pixels - exact dims vs declared, magic bytes, and SVG refs route
      # back through the eyestruct raster gate), and EYES-MEM (the
      # committed labs/.eyes/ ledger: 0 unexplained drift, all rows
      # explained). Family exit contract; skips are NAMED, never fake
      # passes.
      # Eyestruct: the npm pin. The devDependencies carry eyestruct@0.9.0
      # EXACT (the packstruct discipline), so `npm ci` lands the tool in
      # node_modules for every leg - no checkout, no env knobs. The
      # resolvers walk OUT from their own ROOT and find the install:
      # poststruct-staging's own pin (its lockfile) and the root pin (the
      # raster + gate legs), both right here.
      - name: Install (root pin + poststruct's own pin)
        run: |
          npm ci --ignore-scripts
          npm ci --ignore-scripts --prefix poststruct-staging

      - name: Framework gate (poststruct x eyestruct legs)
        run: node scripts/framework-gate.mjs

  # The staging repos are writing repos of their own - they tar over to
  # dhaupin/poststruct, and eyestruct ships as the npm package the
  # devDependency pins pin - so this job is where the batteries prove
  # their loaders/packs/ledgers stay conformant with the packstruct spec
  # all family legs share. The eyestruct devDependency rides the same
  # `npm ci` (no checkout, no env knob); eyestruct's own repo tooling
  # (its test spine, docs gates, packs battery) is eyestruct's repo CI's
  # job - the npm package is tool-only, and gistory consumes it AS a
  # tool. Honest centerpiece: failures fail under their own name.
  staging-hosts:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 22

      - name: Install (devDeps carry the packstruct + eyestruct exact pins)
        run: npm ci --prefix poststruct-staging

      - name: Poststruct battery (test + lint:packs + conform:packs)
        run: npm run check --prefix poststruct-staging

      - name: "Monoforge battery (self-test: stamp + doctor + lock refusals)"
        run: node test/run.mjs
        working-directory: monoforge-staging
